## CI/CD Pipeline

| Stage | Tool | Command |
|-------|------|---------|
| Lint | clippy | `cargo clippy -p {module-name} -- -D warnings` |
| Format | rustfmt | `cargo fmt -p {module-name} -- --check` |
| Test | cargo | `cargo test -p {module-name}` |
| Build | cargo | `cargo build -p {module-name} --release` |
| {stage} | {tool} | `{command}` |

## External Services

| Service | Purpose | Environment Variable |
|---------|---------|---------------------|
| {service} | {purpose} | `{MODULE}_{SERVICE}_URL` |

## Version Pinning Strategy

- **Direct dependencies**: pinned to minor version (`1.2`) in `Cargo.toml`
- **Lock file**: `Cargo.lock` committed for reproducible builds
- **Rust toolchain**: pinned via `rust-toolchain.toml`

## Upgrade Checklist

1. Update dependency version in `Cargo.toml`
2. Run `cargo update -p {crate}`
3. Run full test suite: `cargo test -p {module-name}`
4. Verify clippy passes: `cargo clippy -p {module-name}`
5. Update this document if a tool or dependency changes

